          "value": "10:12",
          "unit": "rise_in_12",
          "kind": "measured"
        }
      },
      "status": "drafted",
      "rule": "Rise:run between 9:12 and 11:12 (own hard constraint c02) -- steep by Georgian standards, against 7:12-9:12 in the Chesapeake, because snow load and the First Period framing habit both push it up. Below 8:12 the house reads Chesapeake or Federal; above 12:12 it reads First Period.",
      "confidence": "high",
      "note": "Specified rather than extends, matching tidewater-georgian's own reasoning for the same slot: the parent's four region-scoped pitch parameters (pitch_new_england among them) would all merge through and sit alongside this restatement as noise once this variant node exists to hold the fact properly (docs/inheritance.md)."
    },
